{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "628bcd7ada348dd22c328c56b7c001174b5cc77bb96f50dcbbad7031490091b9", "ja": "（美也が、初めてオーディションに合格した。\n地方の深夜番組アシスタントだが、合格は合格だ）", "zh": "（美也第一次通过了试镜。\n虽然是地方深夜节目的助理，但录取就是录取。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "12b319a2c8559c8c8ef89bb23e9fc245f8afe9f464c1f82779970965104b24a1", "ja": "美也！　この前受けたTV番組のオーディション、\n合格したぞ！　おめでとう！", "zh": "美也！你通过之前参加的电视节目试镜啰！\n恭喜你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "33cf201559d5ac8640b405b5a8a41334bef1aac2b911c9c53ea8cfe5ec38d946", "ja": "お～、本当ですか～？　やりましたね～。\n私の作戦が、成功したのでしょうか～？", "zh": "喔～真的吗～？太棒了～\n是不是因为我的作战计划成功了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3bcbbd3d087b95b7ff74e697ba6911ce54d016a6fdb481f25cc9eca928a0bd0f", "ja": "作戦……って。\n美也、オーディションで何かしたのか？", "zh": "作战计划……\n美也，你在试镜中做了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "2136e485766627f9b08e755ca4a57726e4d8569f60763ab9831da02838fec508", "ja": "はい、早口言葉を～。番組アシスタントなので、\n滑舌が良いほうが、いいかと思いまして～。", "zh": "是的，我说了绕口令～因为职位是节目助理，\n我想说口齿清晰应该很重要～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a4b18b515503dcb4cf9197e31999536459522e40b07d306be7f7571fe4816297", "ja": "美也、早口言葉なんてできたんだな……。\nそれで、どんなのを披露したんだ？", "zh": "原来美也会绕口令啊……\n那，你说了什么绕口令？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "7eeaf9e62f387b33651548ee796917fedc9639c117abfbcd1c1557b3e23369fa", "ja": "では、やってみましょう～。\n{$P$}さん、準備はいいですか～？", "zh": "那我就说一次吧～\n{$P$}先生，你准备好了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aaf8833f1a10e3f0ca65ab1c2c1214890f6b13ea672725a92bb4b8d3655456c5", "ja": "ああ、どうぞ！", "zh": "嗯，开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "7009fa034a76e6535abb820694f77f066b9dc39ca769792d56cfc376a1948bc1", "ja": "……拙者親方と申すは、御立会の内に御存知の御方も\n御座りましょうが～、御江戸を発って二十里上方～、", "zh": "……说到在下的老板，在座诸位或有人知晓～\n从江户出发上行二十里～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6cefc2a8e7e00da8d0137f210d654727683aa43f490073f90fe386ba5d1ca561", "ja": "（とくに早くない……！）", "zh": "（念得一点也不快……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "419bfc6f453386e7fb19bfb86b77e53618d35d2111978e28f20b8fda454e4ddc", "ja": "相州小田原一色町を御過ぎなされて、青物町を\n登りへ御出でなさるれば、欄干橋虎屋藤右衛門～、", "zh": "步至相州小田原一色町，复越过青物町，\n便能寻得栏干桥虎屋之藤右卫门～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "926b199d250d849bccc4c8606f848b13cabdaca0f275d6da5563f12be3a83c10", "ja": "只今は剃髪致して、円斎と名乗りまする～。", "zh": "他现已剃发为僧，自号为圆斋～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8147ca650ea7549ee4c2b2caa0badda4207bd31345bd34a9b373df96b7b4f3ca", "ja": "美也、もしかしてそれは……。", "zh": "美也，那该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "1b7366d4fa542537200ef212a9805ca1d4a7ab338b8004ff775c80dc3f2c99d3", "ja": "はい～。ういろう売りの口上です～。\n発声や滑舌の練習でも、使いますよね～。", "zh": "没错～是《外郎卖》的台词～\n这段话也会被用在发声和咬字练习上呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58f0204cf94fb016f6e8cce65521b5b93abe01a8e15a91c19f268aabe27a1939", "ja": "うん、たしかに間違ってなかったし、アピールと\nしては個性的だ。それがよかったのかもしれないな！", "zh": "嗯，你念得很正确，这种展现自我的方式也很有特色。\n或许就是这点被相中了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "51406d3b289025982cb84dae8653de7b937cbccc6cbc1662e0192e58559a5cf6", "ja": "むふふ、そうかもしれません～。\nおじいちゃんに感謝ですな～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，或许就是这样吧～\n得好好感谢爷爷才行呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "249b51d34c2763714fddb2e576d530f54c1f20563097f1147e4b4573ada066fc", "ja": "へえ、その口上は、\nおじいさんに教えてもらったのか？", "zh": "哦，这段台词\n是你爷爷教你的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "c24355d7c929f710974b3d62c8138be4a7cc60062ed2f10cba2ce8ac2a0e301c", "ja": "そうなんです～。\n私とおじいちゃん、とっても仲良しなんですよ～。", "zh": "是啊～\n我和爷爷的感情很好喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "b5c42bfc4b5e9bf57f1c82b1e05a593ff9f3b162a33f233dc54e0e8a772ba93a", "ja": "子供のころは、よくおじいちゃんに、\n縁側でお茶を飲みながら遊んでもらいました～。", "zh": "我小时候经常和爷爷坐在窄廊上，\n一边喝茶一边玩游戏～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "b226bd520fd829600e5f59ec6bd636186514503e75fd4369b6146ffa396cb61e", "ja": "囲碁や将棋を指したり、古いお話を聞いたり……\nとっても楽しかったです～。", "zh": "他会陪我下围棋或将棋，也会说民间故事给我听……\n那时真的非常开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "27e3ee06b114f2b3c6444197c3298bede221fb81f85613c121527107f47d447f", "ja": "（そうか。美也の言葉遣いが少し古風なのは、\nおじいさんの影響だったのか……）", "zh": "（这样啊，美也略显古典的用字遣词，\n原来是受到爷爷的影响……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1aac6c0fc731582da43d8f64a19685bc858a8de5c7724d9bea2119b1454668f8", "ja": "なるほど。美也とおじいさんは、仲がいいんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，美也和爷爷的感情很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "d4aca458cc8e3c9743cade4ef754034c6575a72f000eae0a96093679e80b059b", "ja": "はい～。オーディションに合格したこと、\nおじいちゃんに伝えないとですね～。", "zh": "是的～\n也得告诉爷爷我通过试镜的事才行～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "502ddcb576f6495a6c0b25ff04d4ec11b2c2aa41ac463a7323a295b3b1edd31f", "ja": "きっと喜んでくれると思いますよ～。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "他一定会很开心的～\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb4fb5b05a1e4dc7e6774b4f09c240e63729acbe9cdd314b31437d3662846184", "ja": "お～、そうだ。何か、お礼をしないといけませんね～。\nそうですな～。", "zh": "喔～对了，我得送点什么表达谢意才行～\n我想想喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "a161952775ff08515fcd264b71b14eb3ea1680173d2d7900627511e7a2393e8d", "ja": "お歳暮は何がいいですか～？", "zh": "你希望我送什么当年末礼品呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a320d788db8388fa1b43427fafeb138e067502067e9289d0e4fd36ded3708f68", "ja": "……いや、そういうのはいいんだ。それに受かったのは\n俺のおかげじゃなくて、美也の努力の成果だし。", "zh": "……不，不必了。而且，你能通过试镜不是我的功劳，\n是你自己努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "e2bbaa801179e79d755e05ebea3ac366e42a51001a3e226e32ef3297c25ecbb8", "ja": "む～ん……。でもやっぱり、{$P$}\nさんに、ありがとうございます、なんですよ～。", "zh": "唔～嗯……不过我还是想对\n{$P$}先生表达感谢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "712d8f9077c35951196c894c9ce2b81df645b22cdb6935a27c83a9c97646be2f", "ja": "私が何度落ちても、オーディションを受けさせて\nくれたのは、{$P$}さんですから～。", "zh": "因为不论我落选多少次，{$P$}先生\n还是一直让我参加试镜嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fcce89a5f9728dc9f55d9886a5874715d38948b3724e98c04fead6995589358b", "ja": "そうか……。じゃあ、気持ちだけ受け取っておくよ。\nありがとうな。それから、本当におめでとう、美也。", "zh": "这样啊……不过你有这份心意就很足够了，谢谢啰。\n还有，非常恭喜你，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "d9811c346be8d1ca48247f3ec055ca35692e8a1a33c01d6d9315021208b377f3", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます～。\n……なんだか、じーんとしてきましたよ～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，谢谢你～\n……总觉得有点感动～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdbd7d4704721ff411806fd6363def100bcc964556757da377eadb22aa82704b", "ja": "{$P$}さんに褒めてもらって、\n嬉しさが何倍にもなりました～。", "zh": "能得到{$P$}先生的夸奖，\n让人格外开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "43b734cdecdcf8ddccffd82e9c13edf5b2b64c191f0154664561376d4eb6f838", "ja": "このことも、おじいちゃんに話さないとですね～。\nふふふ。", "zh": "我也要把这件事一起告诉爷爷～\n呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "792af0b31303bdd6aa292f98ed0274c0b6e7366c1ef405b1a14a2acbd38b48c9", "ja": "（柔らかな言葉と笑顔の奥に宿っている、\n確かな夢と強い意志……）", "zh": "（在美也柔和的话语及笑容背后，\n寄宿着坚定的梦想与强韧的意志……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_005_1034_p", "source_sha256": "50b1be2881f93f0f795e48291384d3b5383b5d78b8dccbc419ea95e81da5a6e3", "ja": "（今はまだ小さな仕事でも、これから少しずつ。\n一緒に階段を上っていこう！）", "zh": "（现在虽然只有微不足道的工作，\n但聚沙成塔，让我们一起向上爬吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
